@startuml sequence-dag-run
!pragma layout smetana
title Beam: one run, trigger to balance

actor Operator
participant "Airflow\n(Composer)" as Composer
participant "GCS" as GCS
participant "Beam pods\n(Dataflow)" as Beam
participant "Dataform\nrunner" as Dataform
database "BigQuery" as BQ
participant "load" as Loader
queue "Kafka" as Kafka
participant "Target System\nmock" as Mock
participant "recon" as Recon

Operator -> Composer: Trigger DAG {"run_id": "run-2026...."}
Composer -> GCS: Poll extraction/<run_id>/ACCOUNT.FLG\n(reschedule, up to 12h)
GCS --> Composer: Semaphore present

Composer -> Beam: intake
Beam -> GCS: Read encrypted bundle, verify .CHS
Beam -> BQ: account_src + run_ledger + record_lineage
Beam --> Composer: Done

Composer -> Dataform: curate_run
Dataform -> BQ: Build etlr_transformation.account_curated
Dataform --> Composer: Done

Composer -> Beam: enrich
Beam -> BQ: Read account_curated, write account_enriched
Beam --> Composer: Done

Composer -> Beam: produce (--sinks both)
Beam -> BQ: Read account_enriched, map + validate
Beam -> GCS: Write JSON batches of exactly 200
Beam -> Kafka: Publish target documents
Beam --> Composer: Done

Composer -> Loader: loader_app (--sink kafka)
Loader -> GCS: Read JSON batches
Loader -> Kafka: Produce to target topic
Kafka -> Mock: Deliver documents
Mock -> Kafka: Confirmations / rejections
Kafka --> Loader: Settle within timeout
Loader -> GCS: Write .ERR for rejected
note right of Loader: Anything neither confirmed nor\nrejected is "unsettled" — non-zero fails
Loader --> Composer: Done

Composer -> Recon: reconciliation
Kafka --> Recon: Read confirmation stream
Recon -> BQ: Set-difference against account_target
Recon --> Composer: Done

Composer -> BQ: assert_run_balanced — read run_ledger
BQ --> Composer: src_read, extraction_written, rejected, balanced
alt balanced
  Composer --> Operator: Run succeeded
else not balanced
  Composer --> Operator: Run FAILED — the equation did not close
end
@enduml
